        "synonyms": [
          "Thigh bone"
        ]
      },
      {
        "description": "The shin bone is the larger of the two lower leg bones and carries most of the body's weight. Its broad, flat top supports the thigh bone, and a small bump at the front receives the patellar ligament.",
