      {
        "description": "The medial meniscus is a C-shaped pad of tough cartilage on the inner half of the shin bone's top surface. It deepens the seat for the inner knob of the thigh bone and is joined at its edge to the medial collateral ligament.",
        "englishName": "Medial meniscus",
